{"id":"662801","name":"紫苏焖鸭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662801/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"紫苏叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生姜洗净切片。","img":"images/662801/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸭子冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/662801/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/662801/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入鸭肉。","img":"images/662801/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大火快速翻炒。","img":"images/662801/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，老抽，盐。","img":"images/662801/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/662801/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662801/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大火煮开转小火焖45分钟左右。","img":"images/662801/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"紫苏叶洗净备用","img":"images/662801/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鸭肉焖软烂入味收一下汁。","img":"images/662801/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入紫苏叶，大火煮开至断生即可。","img":"images/662801/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662801/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662801/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}